'</style>',
'</head>',
'',
'<body>',
'',
'<!-- ========================= ORACLE APEX MODULE 2 : WORKSPACE & ENVIRONMENT ========================= -->',
'',
'<!-- <h2>Module 2: APEX Workspace & Environment</h2> -->',
'',
'<p>',
'This module explains how to access Oracle APEX,',
'create a workspace, and understand the APEX development environment.',
'</p>',
'',
'<hr>',
'',
'<h3>6. Creating APEX Workspace</h3>',
'',
'<p>',
'A <b>Workspace</b> is a logical area in Oracle APEX',
'where applications, database objects, and users are managed.',
'</p>',
'',
'<div class="note">',
'One workspace can contain multiple applications',
'and database schemas.',
'</div>',
'',
'<hr>',
'',
'<h3>7. APEX Login & Navigation</h3>',
'',
'<p>',
'After workspace creation, users can log in',
'using the <b>workspace name</b>, <b>username</b>,',
'and <b>password</b>.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'Once logged in, the APEX home page is displayed.',
'</p>',
'',
'<hr>',
'',
'<h3>8. APEX Home Dashboard</h3>',
'',
'<p>',
'The <b>APEX Home Dashboard</b> provides access to:',
'</p>',
'',
'<ul>',
'  <li>App Builder</li>',
'  <li>SQL Workshop</li>',
'  <li>Team Development</li>',
'  <li>Gallery</li>',
'</ul>',
'',
'<div class="note">',
'Most development work is done using',
'<b>App Builder</b> and <b>SQL Workshop</b>.',
'</div>',
'',
'<hr>',
'',
'<h3>9. Understanding APEX Components</h3>',
'',
'<p>',
'Oracle APEX is divided into different components,',
'each used for a specific purpose.',
'</p>',
'',
'<ul>',
unistr('  <li><b>App Builder</b> \2013 Create and manage applications</li>'),
unistr('  <li><b>SQL Workshop</b> \2013 Work with database objects</li>'),
unistr('  <li><b>Team Development</b> \2013 Manage tasks and bugs</li>'),
'</ul>',
'',
'<hr>',
'',
'<h3>10. APEX Application Builder Overview</h3>',
'',
'<p>',
'<b>Application Builder</b> is the core component',
'used to design pages, regions, items, and logic.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'It provides a <b>low-code environment</b>',
'that reduces manual coding.',
'</p>',
'',
'<div class="note">',
'Using Application Builder,',
'developers can create applications',
'without writing large amounts of code.',
'</div>',
'',
'<hr>',
'',
'<h2>In Simple Words</h2>',
'',
'<p>',
'<b>Module 2</b> explains how to enter the Oracle APEX world,',
'create a workspace, understand the dashboard,',
'and start working with Application Builder.',
'</p>',
'',
'</body>',
'</html>',
''))
,p_ai_enabled=>false
