'',
'<p>',
'This module explains how to create and manage',
'<b>Oracle APEX applications</b>.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'You will learn how applications are structured',
'and how pages are created and maintained.',
'</p>',
'',
'<hr>',
'',
'<h3>11. Creating a New Application</h3>',
'',
'<p>',
'Oracle APEX provides a <b>Create Application Wizard</b>',
'that helps developers quickly create applications.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'The wizard allows selection of pages,',
'navigation style, and application features.',
'</p>',
'',
'<div class="note">',
'Creating applications using the wizard',
'is the fastest way to start development.',
'</div>',
'',
'<hr>',
'',
'<h3>12. Application Definition</h3>',
'',
'<p>',
'The <b>Application Definition</b> contains',
'global settings of an application.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'These settings include:',
'</p>',
'',
'<ul>',
'  <li>Application name and ID</li>',
'  <li>Authentication scheme</li>',
'  <li>Global security settings</li>',
'</ul>',
'',
'<hr>',
'',
'<h3>13. Pages & Page Designer</h3>',
'',
'<p>',
'Each Oracle APEX application consists of',
'<b>multiple pages</b>.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'Pages are created and modified using',
'the <b>Page Designer</b>.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'Page Designer provides a visual layout',
'to manage regions, items, buttons,',
'processes, and dynamic actions.',
'</p>',
'',
'<hr>',
'',
'<h3>14. Running & Deleting Applications</h3>',
'',
'<p>',
'Applications can be executed using the',
'<b>Run Application</b> option.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'If an application is no longer required,',
'it can be deleted from the App Builder.',
'</p>',
'',
'<div class="note">',
'Always export an application',
'before deleting it to avoid data loss.',
'</div>',
'',
'<hr>',
'',
'<h2>In Simple Words</h2>',
'',
'<p>',
'<b>Module 3</b> explains how to create',
'an Oracle APEX application,',
'understand application settings,',
'work with pages, and manage applications.',
'</p>',
'',
'</body>',
'</html>',
''))
