'<html lang="en">',
'<head>',
'<meta charset="UTF-8">',
unistr('<title>Oracle APEX \2013 Module 5</title>'),
'',
'<style>',
'/* ===================== ORACLE APEX MODULE 5 CSS ===================== */',
'',
'/* Base Style */',
'body {',
'  font-family: "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif;',
'  font-size: 15px;',
'  line-height: 1.7;',
'  color: #333;',
'  background-color: #ffffff;',
'}',
'',
'/* Main Headings */',
'h2 {',
'  margin-top: 35px;',
'  margin-bottom: 12px;',
'  padding-left: 12px;',
'  border-left: 5px solid #1f4fb2;',
'  color: #1f4fb2;',
'  font-size: 22px;',
'}',
'',
'/* Sub Headings */',
'h3 {',
'  margin-top: 22px;',
'  margin-bottom: 8px;',
'  color: #2c6db8;',
'  font-size: 18px;',
'}',
'',
'/* Paragraphs */',
'p {',
'  margin: 8px 0;',
'}',
'',
'/* Lists */',
'ul, ol {',
'  margin-left: 22px;',
'  margin-bottom: 12px;',
'}',
'',
'ul li, ol li {',
'  margin: 6px 0;',
'}',
'',
'/* Divider */',
'hr {',
'  border: none;',
'  height: 1px;',
'  background: #ddd;',
'  margin: 30px 0;',
'}',
'',
'/* Highlight box */',
'.note {',
'  background: #f1f4f9;',
'  border-left: 4px solid #1f4fb2;',
'  padding: 12px 14px;',
'  margin: 15px 0;',
'}',
'',
'/* Responsive */',
'@media (max-width: 768px) {',
'  body { font-size: 14px; }',
'  h2 { font-size: 20px; }',
'  h3 { font-size: 17px; }',
'}',
'</style>',
'</head>',
'',
'<body>',
'',
'<!-- ========================= ORACLE APEX MODULE 5 : REGIONS ========================= -->',
'',
'<!-- <h2>Module 5: Regions in Oracle APEX</h2> -->',
'',
'<p>',
'This module explains different types of <b>Regions</b> in Oracle APEX.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'Regions are the main building blocks of a page',
'used to display data, forms, charts, and static content.',
'</p>',
'',
'<hr>',
'',
'<h3>19. Static Content Region</h3>',
'',
'<p>',
'A <b>Static Content Region</b> is used to display',
'fixed text, HTML, images, or instructions.',
'</p>',
'',
'<div class="note">',
'Static Content regions are commonly used',
'for headings, notes, and help text.',
'</div>',
'',
'<hr>',
'',
'<h3>20. Report Region</h3>',
'',
'<p>',
'A <b>Report Region</b> is used to display',
'data from database tables or queries.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'Common report types include:',
'</p>',
'',
'<ul>',
'  <li>Classic Report</li>',
'  <li>Interactive Report</li>',
'  <li>Interactive Grid</li>',
'</ul>',
'',
'<hr>',
'',
'<h3>21. Form Region</h3>',
'',
'<p>',
'A <b>Form Region</b> is used to insert,',
'update, or delete records from a table.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'Forms can be created using:',
'</p>',
'',
'<ul>',
'  <li>Form Wizard</li>',
'  <li>Manual Page Designer</li>',
'</ul>',
'',
'<div class="note">',
'Form regions are usually linked',
'with page processes and validations.',
'</div>',
'',
'<hr>',
'',
'<h3>22. Chart Region</h3>',
'',
'<p>',
'A <b>Chart Region</b> is used to display',
'data graphically.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'Oracle APEX supports various charts such as:',
'</p>',
'',
'<ul>',
'  <li>Bar Chart</li>',
'  <li>Line Chart</li>',
'  <li>Pie Chart</li>',
'</ul>',
'',
'<hr>',
'',
'<h3>23. Cards Region</h3>',
'',
'<p>',
'A <b>Cards Region</b> is used to display',
'data in a modern card-based layout.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'It is commonly used for dashboards',
'and overview pages.',
'</p>',
'',
'<div class="note">',
'Cards region improves UI and user experience.',
'</div>',
'',
'<hr>',
'',
'<h3>24. List & Breadcrumb Region</h3>',
'',
'<p>',
'<b>List Regions</b> are used for navigation menus',
'and shortcuts.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'<b>Breadcrumb Regions</b> show',
'the current page location in the application.',
'</p>',
'',
'<hr>',
'',
'<h2>In Simple Words</h2>',
'',
'<p>',
'<b>Module 5</b> explains how different regions',
'are used to design pages in Oracle APEX.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'Regions control <b>what is shown</b>',
'and <b>how data is displayed</b> on a page.',
'</p>',
'',
'</body>',
'</html>',
''))
,p_ai_enabled=>false
,p_attributes=>wwv_flow_t_plugin_attributes(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
  'expand_shortcuts', 'N',
