'  background: #f1f4f9;',
'  border-left: 4px solid #1f4fb2;',
'  padding: 12px 14px;',
'  margin: 15px 0;',
'}',
'',
'/* Responsive */',
'@media (max-width: 768px) {',
'  body { font-size: 14px; }',
'  h2 { font-size: 20px; }',
'  h3 { font-size: 17px; }',
'}',
'</style>',
'</head>',
'',
'<body>',
'',
'<!-- ========================= ORACLE APEX MODULE 6 : REPORTS ========================= -->',
'',
'<h2>Module 6: Reports</h2>',
'',
'<p>',
'This module explains different types of <b>Reports</b> in Oracle APEX',
'used to display data from database tables and queries.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'Reports are a core feature of Oracle APEX applications.',
'</p>',
'',
'<hr>',
'',
'<h3>25. Classic Report</h3>',
'',
'<p>',
'A <b>Classic Report</b> displays data in a simple tabular format.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'It is easy to create and suitable for basic reporting needs.',
'</p>',
'',
'<div class="note">',
'Classic Reports are best when you need',
'full control over layout and SQL.',
'</div>',
'',
'<hr>',
'',
'<h3>26. Interactive Report</h3>',
'',
'<p>',
'An <b>Interactive Report</b> allows end users',
'to customize the report output.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'Users can:',
'</p>',
'',
'<ul>',
'  <li>Filter and sort data</li>',
'  <li>Hide or show columns</li>',
'  <li>Download data</li>',
'</ul>',
'',
'<hr>',
'',
'<h3>27. Interactive Grid</h3>',
'',
'<p>',
'An <b>Interactive Grid</b> is an advanced report',
'that allows <b>editing data directly</b> in the grid.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'It supports:',
'</p>',
'',
'<ul>',
'  <li>Insert</li>',
'  <li>Update</li>',
'  <li>Delete</li>',
'</ul>',
'',
'<div class="note">',
'Interactive Grids are commonly used',
'for complex data entry screens.',
'</div>',
'',
'<hr>',
'',
'<h3>28. Report Attributes</h3>',
'',
'<p>',
'Report attributes control how data is displayed.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'These include:',
'</p>',
'',
'<ul>',
'  <li>Column formatting</li>',
'  <li>Pagination</li>',
'  <li>Sorting options</li>',
'</ul>',
'',
'<hr>',
'',
'<h3>29. Report Formatting</h3>',
'',
'<p>',
'Oracle APEX allows formatting reports using:',
'</p>',
'',
'<ul>',
'  <li>Column properties</li>',
'  <li>HTML expressions</li>',
'  <li>CSS styles</li>',
'</ul>',
'',
'<p>',
'This helps improve readability and user experience.',
'</p>',
'',
'<hr>',
'',
'<h2>In Simple Words</h2>',
'',
'<p>',
'<b>Module 6</b> explains how Oracle APEX',
'displays data using different report types.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'Reports help users <b>view, analyze, and manage</b>',
'database information effectively.',
'</p>',
'',
'</body>',
'</html>',
''))
,p_ai_enabled=>false
,p_attributes=>wwv_flow_t_plugin_attributes(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
  'expand_shortcuts', 'N',
