'p {',
'  margin: 8px 0;',
'}',
'',
'/* Lists */',
'ul, ol {',
'  margin-left: 22px;',
'  margin-bottom: 12px;',
'}',
'',
'ul li, ol li {',
'  margin: 6px 0;',
'}',
'',
'/* Divider */',
'hr {',
'  border: none;',
'  height: 1px;',
'  background: #ddd;',
'  margin: 30px 0;',
'}',
'',
'/* Highlight box */',
'.note {',
'  background: #f1f4f9;',
'  border-left: 4px solid #1f4fb2;',
'  padding: 12px 14px;',
'  margin: 15px 0;',
'}',
'',
'/* Responsive */',
'@media (max-width: 768px) {',
'  body { font-size: 14px; }',
'  h2 { font-size: 20px; }',
'  h3 { font-size: 17px; }',
'}',
'</style>',
'</head>',
'',
'<body>',
'',
'<!-- ========================= ORACLE APEX MODULE 7 : FORMS ========================= -->',
'',
'<h2>Module 7: Forms</h2>',
'',
'<p>',
'This module explains how to create and manage',
'<b>Forms</b> in Oracle APEX.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'Forms are used to <b>insert, update, and delete</b>',
'records in database tables.',
'</p>',
'',
'<hr>',
'',
'<h3>30. Creating Forms Using Wizard</h3>',
'',
'<p>',
'Oracle APEX provides a <b>Form Wizard</b>',
'to quickly create forms based on database tables.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'The wizard automatically creates:',
'</p>',
'',
'<ul>',
'  <li>Page items</li>',
'  <li>Processes</li>',
'  <li>Buttons</li>',
'</ul>',
'',
'<div class="note">',
'Form Wizard is the fastest way',
'to create standard forms.',
'</div>',
'',
'<hr>',
'',
'<h3>31. Manual Form Creation</h3>',
'',
'<p>',
'Forms can also be created manually',
'using the <b>Page Designer</b>.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'Manual creation gives full control',
'over layout and logic.',
'</p>',
'',
'<hr>',
'',
'<h3>32. Form Processes (Insert, Update, Delete)</h3>',
'',
'<p>',
'Form processes are responsible',
'for saving data to the database.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'Common form processes:',
'</p>',
'',
'<ul>',
'  <li>Insert Row</li>',
'  <li>Update Row</li>',
'  <li>Delete Row</li>',
'</ul>',
'',
'<div class="note">',
'These processes usually run',
'after page submission.',
'</div>',
'',
'<hr>',
'',
'<h3>33. Validations in Forms</h3>',
'',
'<p>',
'<b>Validations</b> ensure that correct data',
'is entered into form items.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'Validations can be defined:',
'</p>',
'',
'<ul>',
'  <li>At item level</li>',
'  <li>At page level</li>',
'</ul>',
'',
'<p>',
'They prevent invalid data',
'from being saved in the database.',
'</p>',
'',
'<hr>',
'',
'<h2>In Simple Words</h2>',
'',
'<p>',
'<b>Module 7</b> explains how Oracle APEX forms',
'are created and how they interact with database tables.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'Forms allow users to <b>manage data safely and easily</b>.',
'</p>',
'',
'</body>',
'</html>',
''))
,p_ai_enabled=>false
,p_attributes=>wwv_flow_t_plugin_attributes(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
