'</head>',
'',
'<body>',
'',
'<!-- ========================= ORACLE APEX MODULE 9 : DATABASE PROGRAMMING ========================= -->',
'',
'<h2>Module 9: Database Programming</h2>',
'',
'<p>',
'This module explains how Oracle APEX works with',
'<b>database-level programming</b> concepts like',
'<b>Triggers</b> and <b>Dynamic SQL</b>.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'These features are commonly used to automate tasks',
'and handle advanced database logic.',
'</p>',
'',
'<hr>',
'',
'<h3>42. Triggers</h3>',
'',
'<p>',
'A <b>Trigger</b> is a PL/SQL program that is',
'<b>automatically executed</b> when a specific',
'event occurs on a table or view.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'Triggers are mainly used for:',
'</p>',
'',
'<ul>',
'  <li>Data validation</li>',
'  <li>Auditing</li>',
'  <li>Automatic data handling</li>',
'</ul>',
'',
'<hr>',
'',
'<h3>43. Types of Triggers</h3>',
'',
'<p>',
'Triggers can be classified based on timing:',
'</p>',
'',
'<ul>',
'  <li><b>BEFORE Trigger</b></li>',
'  <li><b>AFTER Trigger</b></li>',
'  <li><b>INSTEAD OF Trigger</b></li>',
'</ul>',
'',
'<div class="note">',
'INSTEAD OF triggers are mostly used on views.',
'</div>',
'',
'<hr>',
'',
'<h3>44. Trigger Timing & Events</h3>',
'',
'<p>',
'Triggers can fire on the following events:',
'</p>',
'',
'<ul>',
'  <li>INSERT</li>',
'  <li>UPDATE</li>',
'  <li>DELETE</li>',
'</ul>',
'',
'<p>',
'They can be:',
'</p>',
'',
'<ul>',
'  <li><b>Row-level</b> (FOR EACH ROW)</li>',
'  <li><b>Statement-level</b></li>',
'</ul>',
'',
'<b>Example:</b>',
'<pre>',
'CREATE OR REPLACE TRIGGER trg_emp_ins',
'BEFORE INSERT ON emp',
'FOR EACH ROW',
'BEGIN',
'  :NEW.created_date := SYSDATE;',
'END;',
'</pre>',
'',
'<hr>',
'',
'<h3>45. Dynamic SQL (EXECUTE IMMEDIATE)</h3>',
'',
'<p>',
'<b>Dy',
''))
