'',
'<hr>',
'',
'<h3>46. Application Deployment</h3>',
'',
'<p>',
'Oracle APEX applications are deployed by',
'<b>exporting and importing</b> application files.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'Deployment is commonly done between:',
'</p>',
'',
'<ul>',
