'',
'<hr>',
'',
'<h3>50. APEX Development Best Practices</h3>',
'',
'<p>',
'Following best practices helps create',
'<b>maintainable and scalable</b> applications.',
'</p>',
'',
'<ul>',
'  <li>Use meaningful naming conventions</li>',
'  <li>Modularize page logic</li>',
'  <li>Secure sensitive data</li>',
'  <li>Document application changes</li>',
'</ul>',
'',
'<hr>',
'',
'<h2>In Simple Words</h2>',
'',
'<p>',
'<b>Module 10</b> explains how to deploy,',
'secure, optimize, and maintain',
'Oracle APEX applications professionally.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'These practices help you build',
'<b>production-ready applications</b>.',
'</p>',
