'}',
'</style>',
'</head>',
'',
'<body>',
'',
'<!-- ========================= UI & THEMING ========================= -->',
'',
'<h2>UI & Theming</h2>',
'',
'<p>',
'This section explains how to design',
'<b>attractive, responsive, and consistent</b>',
'user interfaces in Oracle APEX.',
'</p>',
'',
'<hr>',
'',
'<h3>Universal Theme</h3>',
'',
'<p>',
'The <b>Universal Theme</b> is the default UI framework in Oracle APEX.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'It provides:',
'</p>',
'',
'<ul>',
'  <li>Responsive layouts</li>',
'  <li>Modern UI components</li>',
'  <li>Mobile-friendly design</li>',
'</ul>',
'',
'<div class="note">',
'Universal Theme automatically adjusts UI',
'for desktop, tablet, and mobile devices.',
'</div>',
'',
'<hr>',
'',
'<h3>Templates & Layouts</h3>',
'',
'<p>',
'Templates control the structure of pages,',
'regions, buttons, and lists.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'Using templates ensures',
'<b>UI consistency</b> across the application.',
'</p>',
'',
'<hr>',
'',
'<h3>Theme Roller</h3>',
'',
'<p>',
'<b>Theme Roller</b> allows changing application colors,',
'fonts, and styles without writing CSS.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'It is used to:',
'</p>',
'',
'<ul>',
'  <li>Change branding colors</li>',
'  <li>Modify font styles</li>',
'  <li>Preview UI changes instantly</li>',
'</ul>',
'',
'<hr>',
'',
'<h3>Custom CSS</h3>',
'',
'<p>',
'For advanced customization,',
'developers can add <b>custom CSS</b>',
'at page or application level.',
'</p>',
'',
'<div class="note">',
'Custom CSS is useful when Theme Roller',
'options are not sufficient.',
'</div>',
'',
'<hr>',
'',
'<!-- ========================= DEBUGGING & ERROR HANDLING ========================= -->',
'',
'<h2>Debugging & Error Handling</h2>',
'',
'<p>',
'This section explains how to',
'<b>identify, analyze, and fix errors</b>',
'in Oracle APEX applications.',
'</p>',
'',
'<hr>',
'',
'<h3>Debug Mode</h3>',
'',
'<p>',
'Oracle APEX provides a built-in',
'<b>Debug Mode</b> to trace application execution.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'Debug mode helps:',
'</p>',
'',
'<ul>',
'  <li>Track page processing</li>',
'  <li>Analyze PL/SQL execution</li>',
'  <li>Identify performance issues</li>',
'</ul>',
'',
'<hr>',
'',
'<h3>Error Handling Function</h3>',
'',
'<p>',
'APEX allows defining a',
'<b>Global Error Handling Function</b>',
'to manage errors gracefully.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'It is used to:',
'</p>',
'',
'<ul>',
'  <li>Display user-friendly messages</li>',
'  <li>Log technical errors</li>',
'  <li>Prevent application crashes</li>',
'</ul>',
'',
'<div class="note">',
'Good error handling improves',
'application reliability and user trust.',
'</div>',
'',
'<hr>',
'',
'<h3>Debug Messages</h3>',
'',
'<p>',
'Developers can use',
'<b>APEX_DEBUG.MESSAGE</b>',
'to log custom debug information.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'This is helpful during',
'development and testing.',
'</p>',
'',
'<hr>',
'',
'<!-- ========================= DEPLOYMENT & BEST PRACTICES ========================= -->',
'',
'<h2>Deployment & Best Practices</h2>',
'',
'<p>',
'This section focuses on making applications',
'<b>production-ready</b> and maintainable.',
'</p>',
'',
'<hr>',
'',
'<h3>Application Deployment</h3>',
'',
'<p>',
'Oracle APEX applications are deployed using',
'<b>Export & Import</b> functionality.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'Typical environments include:',
'</p>',
'',
'<ul>',
'  <li>Development</li>',
'  <li>Testing</li>',
'  <li>Production</li>',
'</ul>',
'',
'<div class="note">',
'Always test applications thoroughly',
'before production deployment.',
'</div>',
'',
'<hr>',
'',
'<h3>Security Best Practices</h3>',
'',
'<p>',
'Security is a key part of APEX development.',
'</p>',
'',
'<ul>',
'  <li>Use authorization schemes</li>',
'  <li>Protect session state</li>',
'  <li>Avoid hard-coded credentials</li>',
'</ul>',
'',
'<hr>',
'',
'<h3>Performance Best Practices</h3>',
'',
'<p>',
'Performance optimization ensures',
'smooth user experience.',
'</p>',
'',
'<ul>',
'  <li>Write optimized SQL</li>',
'  <li>Use indexes properly</li>',
'  <li>Limit unnecessary processes</li>',
'</ul>',
'',
'<hr>',
'',
'<h3>Maintainability Guidelines</h3>',
'',
'<ul>',
'  <li>Use clear naming conventions</li>',
'  <li>Document application changes</li>',
'  <li>Reuse shared components</li>',
'</ul>',
'',
'<hr>',
'',
'<h2>In Simple Words</h2>',
'',
'<p>',
'This section explains how to',
'<b>design beautiful interfaces</b>,',
'<b>debug applications efficiently</b>,',
'and <b>deploy secure, high-performance',
'Oracle APEX applications</b>.',
'</p>',
'',
'</body>',
'</html>',
''))
,p_ai_enabled=>false
,p_attributes=>wwv_flow_t_plugin_attributes(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
  'expand_shortcuts', 'N',
  'output_as', 'HTML')).to_clob
);
end;
